#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0132 expect=skipped domain=ADSL
#note "Dataset NAME test runs first in AdamDataStructureDetector.detect, so ADSL is SUBJECT LEVEL ANALYSIS DATASET despite PARAMCD/AVAL columns, which is not in [BDS, MDBDS] -> out of scope, never runs, even though the data WOULD fire."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADSL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL    type=Num
col BASE    type=Num
col R2BASE  type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALB | 10 | 5 | 3
---
